# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Get a free TMDB API key at: https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
# (Sign up → Settings → API → Request API Key → choose "Developer")

# No spaces or quotes around the key
TMDB_API_KEY=your_key_here

# Same key for the React app in the browser (Vite requires VITE_ prefix)
VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=your_key_here



VITE_* vars end up in the browser bundle — users can see them in DevTools. TMDB keys are meant for client-side use with rate limits; don’t treat them like server-only secrets.